<title>HONG KONG: Wah Kwong 1996/97 net down 25.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Wah Kwong 1996/97 net down 25.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	   32.0   vs  43.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (U.S. cents)    5.5    vs  5.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    40.64  vs  54.33</p>
<p>    Turnover		     141.42 vs  151.64</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wah Kwong Shipping Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 1-8</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   August 25</p>
<p>NOTE - Wah Kwong Shipping Holdings is a ship owning group.</p>
<p>Share earnings are based on the weighted average of 127.61 million shares vs 126.72 million shares.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is seven U.S. cents (including interim dividend of 1.5 U.S. cents) vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
